sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Translated application
    participant V as Valgrind core
    participant K as Host kernel
    participant M as Tool metadata

    A->>V: Reach a logical system call
    V->>V: Validate and prepare arguments
    V->>K: Issue real host system call
    K-->>V: Return result and modified memory
    V->>M: Update addressability or definedness state
    V-->>A: Resume translated execution
